  "description": "Cottagecore vegetable gift tags featuring heirloom root vegetables such as carrots, cabbage, and tomatoes, illustrated in a vintage botanical style with soft muted earthy tones, lino print texture, and subtle paper grain. Ideal for rustic, handmade, and eco-friendly packaging, these gift tags add a natural farmhouse aesthetic to any product or present.\nPerfect for enhancing gift wrapping, product packaging, and seasonal branding, these printable vegetable tags bring a cohesive cottagecore and farm-to-table feel to handmade shops and creative projects.\nWhat’s included:\n– High-quality printable single gift tag, 300dpi, PNG with transparent background\n– Clean, professional layout on a Letter-sized and A4 sheet, 300 dpi, PNG with transparent background optimized for print and cut\n– Clean, professional layout on a Letter-sized and A4 sheet, 300 dpi, PDF optimized for home print\nThese cottagecore vegetable gift tags are ideal for:\n* Handmade shop owners packaging handmade goods, artisan food, and eco products\n* Farmers market sellers labeling produce, jars, and seasonal bundles\n* Homemade food creators packaging jams, sauces, baked goods, and preserves\n* Gift basket and hamper creators designing rustic, themed gift sets\n* Eco-friendly brands creating sustainable, botanical packaging labels\n* Homesteaders and garden enthusiasts labeling homegrown gifts and harvest products\n* Wedding and event planners styling rustic, cottagecore, or farmhouse favors\n* Scrapbooking and journaling creators using decorative ephemera elements\n* DIY crafters using Cricut/Silhouette for cut-and-print packaging tags",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Cottagecore vegetable gift tags featuring heirloom root vegetables such as carrots, cabbage, and tomatoes, illustrated in a vintage botanical style with soft muted earthy tones, lino print texture, and subtle paper grain. Ideal for rustic, handmade, and eco-friendly packaging, these gift tags add a natural farmhouse aesthetic to any product or present.</p>\n<p>Perfect for enhancing gift wrapping, product packaging, and seasonal branding, these printable vegetable tags bring a cohesive cottagecore and farm-to-table feel to handmade shops and creative projects.</p>\n<p>What’s included:</p>\n<p>– High-quality printable single gift tag, 300dpi, PNG with transparent background<br>\n– Clean, professional layout on a Letter-sized and A4 sheet, 300 dpi, PNG with transparent background optimized for print and cut<br>\n– Clean, professional layout on a Letter-sized and A4 sheet, 300 dpi, PDF optimized for home print</p>\n<p>These cottagecore vegetable gift tags are ideal for:</p>\n<p>* Handmade shop owners packaging handmade goods, artisan food, and eco products<br>\n* Farmers market sellers labeling produce, jars, and seasonal bundles<br>\n* Homemade food creators packaging jams, sauces, baked goods, and preserves<br>\n* Gift basket and hamper creators designing rustic, themed gift sets<br>\n* Eco-friendly brands creating sustainable, botanical packaging labels<br>\n* Homesteaders and garden enthusiasts labeling homegrown gifts and harvest products<br>\n* Wedding and event planners styling rustic, cottagecore, or farmhouse favors<br>\n* Scrapbooking and journaling creators using decorative ephemera elements<br>\n* DIY crafters using Cricut/Silhouette for cut-and-print packaging tags</p>",
